                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't understand the connection between \"Therefore\" and the preceding statement.  Why do we care if the objects disappear?  If you stop the daemon they're definitely doing to disappear, so how have you made anything \"better\"?\n\nThere is almost no scenario where I'm going to accept adding an explicit dependency between two openbmc services on a specific machine.  If there is a bug where two daemons don't interact nicely with each other, we need to fix them."
